55:### 2.2 PCL && Eigen && OpenCV
57:PCL>=1.8, Follow [PCL Installation](https://pointclouds.org/). 
59:Eigen>=3.3.4, Follow [Eigen Installation](https://eigen.tuxfamily.org/index.php?title=Main_Page).
61:OpenCV>=4.2, Follow [Opencv Installation](http://opencv.org/).
63:### 2.3 Sophus
65:Sophus Installation for the non-templated/double-only version.
68:git clone https://github.com/strasdat/Sophus.git
69:cd Sophus
71:mkdir build && cd build && cmake ..
76:### 2.4 Vikit
78:Vikit contains camera models, some math and interpolation functions that we need. Vikit is a catkin project, therefore, download it into your catkin workspace source folder.
82:cd catkin_ws/src
83:git clone https://github.com/xuankuzcr/rpg_vikit.git 
86:## 3. Build
88:Clone the repository and catkin_make:
91:cd ~/catkin_ws/src
92:git clone https://github.com/hku-mars/FAST-LIVO2
94:catkin_make
95:source ~/catkin_ws/devel/setup.bash
